# Multi-repository workflow rules

## Project structure

The project consists of two main repositories:

- **gurusolutions.co** - frontend (Angular) in the `client/` directory
- **gurusolutions.co.api** - backend (.NET) in the `server/` directory

## Working with paths

- When working on the frontend, use paths relative to `client/`
- When working on the backend, use paths relative to `server/`
- Specify full paths when necessary

## API consistency

- When changing the API on the backend, update corresponding interfaces and services on the frontend
- Use constants from `API_ENDPOINTS` for all API requests
- Follow API versioning (`api/v{version:apiVersion}`)

## Shared resources

- Translations are in `client/src/assets/i18n/`
- Shared types and interfaces must be consistent between frontend and backend
